so-text-raise: 0pt\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">휴학자는 휴학신청일부터 근로 불가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">[ex)12.28</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 휴학신청 시</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">12.27</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일까지 근로가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">서약서 제출 없음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근로기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2016. 09. 01.(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-